-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:63 | not later than 5 working days after the day that the employer gives the
-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:64 | notice of retrenchment mentioned in paragraph 3.
-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:65 | [S 781/2021 wef 01/11/2021]
-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:68 | Form of retrenchment report
-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:69 | 5. Every retrenchment report must be in the form provided at the
-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:70 | website of the Ministry of Manpower at http://www.mom.gov.sg,
-- src:EmA1968-S200-2019:71 | unless the Commissioner allows otherwise in any particular case.
@ref para 3(2) (src:EmA1968-S200-2019:52-71)
GIVEN `the answer of para 3(2)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the retrenchment report was given in time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the answer of para 5` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`S 200/2019 the employer met every requirement concerning the report` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must contain all the information specified in the Schedule in relation to"
        IF `the answer of para 3(2)` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "not later than 5 working days after the day that the employer gives the"
        IF NOT `the retrenchment report was given in time` THEN JUST FALSE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "unless the Commissioner allows otherwise in any particular case"
        IF `the answer of para 5` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): no requirement is shown to be unmet, but the Schedule's lists are not closed
        OTHERWISE NOTHING
